{#- Minimal chat template for base/instruction-tuned models that ship no chat_template of their
    own (confirmed: airavata-7b, openhathi-7b, navarasa-2.0-7b). vLLM's OpenAI server hard-requires
    a template and 400s without one - this replicates HFTransformersAdapter's own fallback exactly
    (system + "\n\n" + user prompt, plain text, no special tokens) so behavior is identical between
    the HF and vLLM backends for these models. -#}
{%- for message in messages -%}
    {%- if message['role'] == 'system' -%}
        {{ message['content'] }}

    {%- elif message['role'] == 'user' -%}
        {{ message['content'] }}
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
